	"identifying_description": "Woman's light gold silk and metallic thread complex weave wedding dress comprised of top, skirt, belt, and shawl: (a) top with round neck and short sleeves; zipper closure at back with hook and eye at top; slit at each side of hip; (b) full skirt gathered at waist, and secured with four hook and eye and single button closure at back; embellished throughout with silk and metallic thread embroidery in couched, chain, stem, satin, and knot stitches forming scroll and paisley designs, three embroidered bands at hem; gold silk lining with basting stitches still visible along bottom edge of hem; (c) long belt with silk and metallic thread embroidery in couched and satin stitches with silk braid edging; five snaps for closure; and (d) large shawl embellished throughout with silk and metallic thread embroidery in couched, chain, stem, satin, and knot stitches forming scroll and paisley designs, three embroidered bands at edges.",
